{
    "title": "Spider Solitaire: Card Games",
    "description": "Spider Solitaire is one of the most popular Spider games in the world! Join over 100 million users playing our free Spider Solitaire game today.\r\n\r\nNow available to play FREE and offline, can you beat Daily Challenges in Spider Solitaire? This ads free game will puzzle, train your brain, and bring back that classic Spider Solitaire games feel!\r\n\r\nSpider Solitaire has NEW WEEKLY EVENTS, where youl travel the world by completing unique hands of Spider Solitaire. Beat the challenges and become a Spider Solitaire pro to earn a unique travel event badge each week!\r\n\r\nIf you like easy and fun card games for adults like Spades, Castle Solitaire, Pinochle, Freecell, Spiderette, Hearts and Rummy or other types of Solitaire like Klondike and Pyramid, then Spider Solitaire is for you! It\u2019s the best free cards games and Spider app you can play offline to relax AND become a Spider Solitaire Pro!\r\n\r\nPlaying Spider games is easy if you\u2019re a sharp Spider Solitaire pro. Place all the cards in each suit in stacks of descending order. Train your brain as you move up in difficulty to become a Spider Solitaire master in this Spider app for iPhone or iPad!\r\n\r\nSpider Solitaire challenges your brain as you to stack all cards of each suit in descending order to solve the puzzle. Try it to climb the leaderboard as the best Spider Solitaire games master in one of the top ad free spyder card games you can play offline on iPhone or iPad to relax.\r\n\r\nDownload Spider Solitaire and play our fun card games \u2013 FREE!\r\n\r\n- Spider Solitaire Card Game Features -\r\n\r\nFree Spider Solitaire Card Game of Classic Solitaire\r\n- Classic Solitaire, totally free on your phone or iPad\r\n- Spider Solitaire games come in 1, 2, 3 & 4 suit varieties\r\n- Cards come alive with animations, graphics and classic spyder games interface for iPhone or iPad\r\n\r\nPlay Free classic Spider Solitaire games any time\r\n- The best Winning Deals guarantee at least one winning solution\r\n- Unrestricted Deal allows player to deal cards with empty slots\r\n- Unlimited undos and automatic hints\r\n- Play offline! No wi-fi needed for this free Spider app with no ads\r\n\r\nNew Weekly Events feature\r\n- Travel the world with a new event location every week\r\n- Complete unique challenges that keep you sharp by playing hands of classic spyder cards games\r\n- Relax and visit new destinations to earn unique travel badges in spider games\r\n\r\n\r\nExercise and Train Your Brain With Challenges\r\n- Spider Solitaire is a fun, free and challenging puzzle game Spider app for those who love free cards games for adults with no ads\r\n- Brain games that keep you sharp range from one-suit to four-suit\r\n- Become a Spider Solitaire pro and challenge yourself as hands get harder in this fun card games\r\n- If you like free card games like Klondike, Freecell, Castle Solitaire, Pinochle and Spiderette, this spyder app is the best\r\n\r\nOld School Classic Spider Solitaire Game\r\n- This free spyder game is the most fun card games! It\u2019s the best ads free games to relax\r\n- Fun across all game levels that will challenge you, train your brain, and keep you sharp\r\n- One of the most fun ads free cards games for adults, like Klondike, Castle Solitaire, Spiderette, Pinochle, Freecell and Hearts\r\n\r\nCustomize your classic Spider Solitaire Game\r\n- Track your games stats\r\n- Custom pictures for card backs and backgrounds\r\n- Tap to move for quick gameplay\r\n- Right hand or left hand play\r\n- Landscape or portrait view for iPhone or iPad\r\n\r\nIs Spider Solitaire for Me?\r\n- Do you like classic and free card games for adults like Spades, Castle Solitaire, Pinochle, Spiderette, Freecell, Hearts and Rummy?\r\n- Do you enjoy other types of Solitaire like Klondike, Castle Solitaire, Pinochle, Pyramid, Freecell Solitaire, Spiderette, or Spiderwort?\r\n- This is one of the most fun card games to become a Spider Solitaire pro and relax\r\n\r\nDon\u2019t miss this free Solitaire game and download the best Spider app now!\r\n\r\nhttp://www.mobilityware.com\r\n\r\nFor answers to frequently asked questions, head to:\r\nhttp://www.mobilityware.com/support.php",
